### Register user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "Test",
  "last_name": "User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}